{"fixes":[{"id":2,"status":"resolved","note":"Synthesis context appends the SDK response messages containing the attempt's assistant tool calls and tool results."},{"id":3,"status":"not-resolved","note":"The 60s timer bounds synthResult.text, but the preceding await result.response is unbounded; this same response promise is documented later as capable of hanging."},{"id":4,"status":"resolved","note":"Caller-originated cancellation during the synthesis model call now emits interrupted and returns."},{"id":5,"status":"not-resolved","note":"The immediate empty synthesis retries correctly, but a fallback/nudge/verify re-entry with _synthesized=true can produce tool-only output and be accepted because needsSynthesis and isEmpty are both false."},{"id":6,"status":"resolved","note":"The synthesis-attempted flag is propagated through fallback, tool-nudge, and verification recursion."},{"id":10,"status":"resolved","note":"A root run-cost baseline is propagated through all recursive paths and aggregate costUsd uses its delta."},{"id":11,"status":"resolved","note":"Parallel phases now require at least one nonblank agent result and otherwise fail."},{"id":12,"status":"resolved","note":"Failed attempt outcomes retain initialStopCause instead of being overwritten with empty_output."},{"id":13,"status":"resolved","note":"Paused, completed, and failed pipeline terminals are finalized before being yielded."}],"deferrals_acceptable":false,"new_P0_P1":[{"severity":"P1","file":"packages/core/src/agent/loop.ts","line":1551,"finding":"Forced-synthesis setup can still hang and ignore caller cancellation while awaiting result.response.","suggested_fix":"Race response metadata retrieval against the synthesis timeout and caller signal, or capture response messages during stream consumption."},{"severity":"P1","file":"packages/core/src/agent/loop.ts","line":1633,"finding":"Once _synthesized is inherited, a later tool-only/no-text invocation can silently succeed with hasFinalResponse=false.","suggested_fix":"Make success contingent on hasFinalResponse for tool-only descendants of a logical run that already attempted synthesis."},{"severity":"P1","file":"packages/core/src/agent/loop.ts","line":1562,"finding":"The original 14th finding is undisposed: synthesis usage is now recorded, but the direct model invocation still bypasses the router's hard-budget check.","suggested_fix":"Check the CostTracker budget immediately before invoking synthesis."}]}
